    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as soon as an enemy unit picks an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit of yours as a target; that unit is the target.\n\nWhenever 1 of its models is **destroyed** while the unit is yet to be **selected to fight** in this phase, roll a D6, adding 1 if its **[assault doctrine](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines)** is active. On a 4+:\n\n- leave the model on the battlefield for now\n- remove it once its unit has fought or the phase ends, whichever is earlier",
